WEBVTT

00:22.150 --> 00:24.960
♪ Why did you invite me again? ♪

00:27.820 --> 00:33.990
♪ Without good wine, the old immortal won't come ♪

00:39.270 --> 00:40.640
[What If It's Funny?]

00:47.250 --> 00:50.760
[The East New Town project has started!]

01:07.310 --> 01:07.840
Mr. Rong.

01:10.000 --> 01:10.810
I've

01:11.230 --> 01:12.350
brought the master here.

01:12.350 --> 01:13.200
What master?

01:14.370 --> 01:16.500
The one I recommended to you last time.

01:16.590 --> 01:18.120
He's an expert in geomancy.

01:20.150 --> 01:20.870
Mr. Zhou.

01:21.350 --> 01:21.890
Today,

01:21.920 --> 01:23.680
I'm here to bring you wealth.

01:25.280 --> 01:26.900
To bring me wealth?

01:27.000 --> 01:27.530
Exactly.

01:29.310 --> 01:30.480
Do you think

01:30.760 --> 01:31.890
I'm short of wealth?

01:32.000 --> 01:33.729
The wealth is not brought by me.

01:34.640 --> 01:35.240
It's this.

01:36.640 --> 01:38.500
I brought this specially for you.

01:41.490 --> 01:42.920
This God of Wealth...

01:42.920 --> 01:44.850
This God of Wealth is not ordinary.

01:45.000 --> 01:47.320
After my forty-nine...

01:49.800 --> 01:54.000
[The East New Town project has started!]

01:54.000 --> 01:57.810
[Fang Yong, Director of the Administrative Committee of the East New Town]

01:59.759 --> 02:00.760
Interesting.

02:03.590 --> 02:04.790
Master, where

02:05.280 --> 02:06.410
should I place this?

02:23.310 --> 02:23.840
Master.

02:23.860 --> 02:24.990
Don't speak.

02:25.400 --> 02:26.800
I'm looking for the spot.

02:29.850 --> 02:31.650
Usually, the God of Wealth

02:33.470 --> 02:35.400
sits in the north and faces the south.

02:35.400 --> 02:36.660
This one is different.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.440
Let it sit in the east.

02:38.840 --> 02:39.970
Just place it there.

02:40.579 --> 02:43.530
♪ Why did you invite me again? ♪

02:42.700 --> 02:45.120
[East New Town]

02:46.290 --> 02:52.079
♪ Without good wine, the old immortal won't come ♪

02:49.040 --> 02:51.850
[The East New Town project has started!]

02:51.880 --> 02:54.690
[Fang Yong, Director of the Administrative Committee of the East New Town]

02:54.690 --> 02:56.480
[East New Town]

04:18.839 --> 04:22.590
[Born with Luck]

04:22.640 --> 04:25.590
[Episode 4]

04:25.660 --> 04:30.870
[Sanjiangkou Transportation Center]

04:42.560 --> 04:44.760
Bro, who exactly are we going to target?

04:47.600 --> 04:48.000
Bro.

04:49.920 --> 04:51.320
That's the hardest part.

04:52.270 --> 04:54.130
Our target is a corrupt official,

04:54.360 --> 04:56.480
and it has to be a big one.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.310
But how to determine

04:58.310 --> 04:59.510
who the big corrupt officials is

04:59.510 --> 05:00.800
is a thorny issue.

05:01.120 --> 05:01.870
Over the years, those who
were extremely corrupt

05:01.870 --> 05:03.670
and well-known among the people

05:03.680 --> 05:05.120
have all been arrested.

05:05.720 --> 05:07.000
The ones left are of course

05:07.000 --> 05:08.860
extremely low-key and cautious.

05:10.830 --> 05:12.070
So who exactly is it?

05:32.830 --> 05:34.450
Bro, you haven't said yet.

05:34.680 --> 05:36.140
How do we find this person?

05:37.800 --> 05:39.040
Let's draw a profile of him.

05:39.040 --> 05:39.830
I'll go get a pen from the car.

05:39.830 --> 05:40.760
No need for a pen.

05:41.750 --> 05:43.630
Since the person
is a big corrupt official,

05:43.630 --> 05:44.960
their rank can't be low.

05:45.720 --> 05:47.270
Though those clerks
sitting at the service windows

05:47.270 --> 05:48.750
are so proud of themselves

05:48.750 --> 05:50.040
when selecting a romantic partner

05:50.040 --> 05:51.770
that they act highly arrogant,

05:52.310 --> 05:53.180
they...

05:55.600 --> 05:56.310
Secondly,

05:56.830 --> 05:58.120
the person must have been in a position
of real power

05:58.120 --> 05:59.320
for a number of years.

05:59.680 --> 06:01.270
Otherwise, even if the person
is a big corrupt official,

06:01.270 --> 06:01.970
with limited time,

06:01.970 --> 06:03.770
they can't embezzle much money.

06:04.240 --> 06:04.770
Finally,

06:06.430 --> 06:08.160
the person has to be over forty.

06:08.630 --> 06:09.640
Do you know why?

06:09.720 --> 06:10.460
Why?

06:10.750 --> 06:12.560
Because only older corrupt officials

06:12.560 --> 06:13.560
would be foolish enough

06:13.560 --> 06:16.560
to hide the embezzled money and things
in their homes.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.680
Who is it?

06:27.270 --> 06:27.800
Let's go.

06:28.510 --> 06:30.640
There's a man over there staring at me.

06:30.680 --> 06:31.720
Could he be a cop?

06:43.080 --> 06:44.570
We can't take the coach.

06:44.800 --> 06:45.870
Who is it?

06:57.360 --> 06:57.970
Bro.

06:58.000 --> 06:58.960
Who is it?

07:23.880 --> 07:25.340
Chief, where are we going?

07:26.000 --> 07:27.200
To the train station.

07:27.680 --> 07:29.000
Why the train station?

07:29.360 --> 07:30.890
Wouldn't they take a coach?

07:31.510 --> 07:32.830
I'm sure they'll go to the train station.

07:32.830 --> 07:33.510
Why?

07:34.000 --> 07:36.000
It's an investigator's intuition.

08:02.860 --> 08:04.860
[The East New Town project has started!]

08:04.860 --> 08:06.690
[Fang Yong, Director of the Administrative Committee of the East New Town]

08:07.310 --> 08:08.510
What did you just say?

08:08.720 --> 08:09.680
"What's wrong, bro?"

08:09.680 --> 08:10.910
The sentence before that.

08:10.910 --> 08:11.570
"Who is it?"

08:15.680 --> 08:18.810
The East New Town project has started.

08:19.650 --> 08:22.360
The director
of the administrative committee

08:22.720 --> 08:23.600
is Fang Yong.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.710
Excuse me, excuse me.

08:29.210 --> 08:32.970
[Police]

08:29.510 --> 08:30.630
Excuse me.

08:32.220 --> 08:33.120
Stop. Who are you?

08:33.120 --> 08:33.520
Hello.

08:33.549 --> 08:34.630
W-We are police officers
from Sanjiangkou City,

08:34.630 --> 08:36.030
members of a CID branch.

08:36.030 --> 08:37.120
You are police officers, right?

08:37.120 --> 08:37.510
Yes.

08:37.549 --> 08:38.840
We have an important witness to find.

08:38.840 --> 08:39.510
Please

08:39.510 --> 08:40.150
register here.

08:40.150 --> 08:40.480
Okay.

08:40.630 --> 08:41.230
Thank you.

08:48.520 --> 08:49.760
[Police]

08:55.790 --> 08:56.960
Alright, you can go in.

08:56.960 --> 08:57.270
Okay.

08:57.270 --> 08:57.750
Chief!

08:59.270 --> 08:59.750
Chief.

09:00.860 --> 09:01.540
Chief.

09:03.630 --> 09:04.750
One, two, go.

09:05.320 --> 09:06.610
Where, where?

09:06.720 --> 09:07.610
How do we get in?

09:44.670 --> 09:45.810
They are cops.

09:48.000 --> 09:48.510
Yes.

09:48.720 --> 09:49.540
Yes.

09:49.670 --> 09:50.870
It's okay, it's okay.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.200
Li Feng.

10:01.840 --> 10:02.870
Don't do it again.

10:03.030 --> 10:03.690
Jiang Ying.

10:04.150 --> 10:04.720
Last night,

10:04.720 --> 10:05.720
you delivered the takeout to me,

10:05.720 --> 10:06.240
right?

10:07.590 --> 10:08.140
Yes.

10:09.360 --> 10:10.440
Yesterday at your house,

10:10.440 --> 10:12.040
seeing your police uniform,

10:12.480 --> 10:14.150
I knew you were a cop.

10:14.240 --> 10:14.930
Yes, I am.

10:14.960 --> 10:15.490
Don't...

10:16.230 --> 10:17.870
I told you, she delivered it.

10:17.890 --> 10:18.800
We found her.

10:21.480 --> 10:23.020
Come at me.

10:23.390 --> 10:24.580
I killed them all.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.720
It has nothing to do with her.

10:29.030 --> 10:29.900
Li Feng.

10:30.720 --> 10:31.550
Stop it.

10:33.750 --> 10:35.480
I don't want to escape anymore.

10:40.870 --> 10:42.130
Think about our child.

11:03.120 --> 11:03.750
It's fine.

11:06.750 --> 11:08.080
We hid in Sanjiangkou

11:09.120 --> 11:10.300
for over half a year.

11:11.440 --> 11:12.770
We thought we were safe.

11:14.280 --> 11:16.250
But I had a bad feeling last night.

11:17.790 --> 11:18.670
You were checking for drunk driving,

11:18.670 --> 11:20.120
even on non-motorized vehicles.

11:20.120 --> 11:22.180
You were looking for me, weren't you?

11:30.320 --> 11:31.200
I didn't expect

11:31.200 --> 11:32.430
you to find us today.

11:38.000 --> 11:38.440
Fine.

11:40.840 --> 11:42.000
Debts owed

11:43.200 --> 11:44.800
must be paid sooner or later.

12:00.240 --> 12:01.100
I admit defeat.

12:28.080 --> 12:28.720
Ren.

12:28.960 --> 12:29.800
Ren.

12:30.120 --> 12:31.200
Master, what's up?

12:31.240 --> 12:32.970
Well, there's no one else here.

12:33.000 --> 12:33.840
Nobody else is here, Ren.

12:33.840 --> 12:34.440
Come here.

12:37.240 --> 12:37.640
Say it.

12:38.240 --> 12:39.030
No, this thing,

12:39.030 --> 12:41.630
Zheng Yongbing bought it
for only 60,000 yuan.

12:43.270 --> 12:44.120
You said

12:44.120 --> 12:46.000
it cost 160,000.

12:49.120 --> 12:49.670
How much?

12:50.080 --> 12:50.880
160,000 yuan.

12:51.240 --> 12:52.640
How much should I pay you?

12:53.200 --> 12:53.930
60,000 yuan.

12:54.550 --> 12:55.390
Then you quoted Mr. Zhou

12:55.390 --> 12:57.480
260,000 for it.

13:00.360 --> 13:01.290
What do you mean?

13:02.320 --> 13:03.000
I was wondering

13:03.000 --> 13:04.800
if you could pay me a little more.

13:07.600 --> 13:08.840
You are just an extra.

13:09.510 --> 13:10.510
80 yuan per day.

13:11.480 --> 13:12.680
How much did I pay you?

13:13.030 --> 13:13.690
1,000 yuan.

13:17.910 --> 13:19.370
Where's your conscience?

13:19.720 --> 13:20.870
Don't be too greedy.

13:21.480 --> 13:23.000
How about your professional ethics?

13:23.000 --> 13:24.390
Well, what conscience?

13:24.410 --> 13:25.000
Ren.

13:25.360 --> 13:26.630
I nailed it in one take just now.

13:26.630 --> 13:28.960
My professional skills are exceptional.

13:30.320 --> 13:31.850
I will give you another 500.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.080
Get out of here.

13:33.080 --> 13:33.680
Okay.

13:33.960 --> 13:34.820
Thank you, Ren.

13:38.610 --> 13:39.340
Li Penggai.

13:39.720 --> 13:40.320
Come here.

13:41.360 --> 13:42.550
Brother Ren, I was looking for you.

13:42.550 --> 13:44.120
Do you have 500 yuan?

13:44.320 --> 13:46.830
[Li Penggai, Head of the Security Team of Rongcheng Group]

13:45.440 --> 13:46.240
Just 500.

13:51.670 --> 13:52.530
Almost enough.

13:55.670 --> 13:56.440
That's all.

13:56.870 --> 13:57.670
One more word,

13:57.870 --> 14:00.130
and you'll prepare for your own funeral.

14:00.550 --> 14:01.080
Let's go.

14:04.960 --> 14:05.440
Speak.

14:06.750 --> 14:07.610
Ye Jian is dead.

14:10.200 --> 14:11.040
Dead?

14:13.870 --> 14:14.670
How did he die?

14:25.630 --> 14:26.490
Who killed him?

14:29.670 --> 14:30.230
Ren,

14:30.250 --> 14:31.990
what I got earlier is about enough.

14:31.990 --> 14:33.050
I will leave first.

14:44.880 --> 14:48.000
[Fang Yong]

14:54.670 --> 14:55.200
Mr. Rong.

14:55.200 --> 14:55.780
Jianren.

14:56.600 --> 14:57.400
Come and look.

14:59.630 --> 15:00.080
Look.

15:01.510 --> 15:02.450
Does Fang Yong

15:03.150 --> 15:04.750
look like this God of Wealth?

15:05.840 --> 15:06.440
He does.

15:06.630 --> 15:07.560
Look carefully.

15:08.550 --> 15:09.280
So lifelike.

15:11.740 --> 15:12.320
Mr. Rong.

15:13.630 --> 15:14.390
Come out with me.

15:14.390 --> 15:15.990
I need to tell you something.

15:16.390 --> 15:17.320
Just say it here.

15:17.670 --> 15:18.800
Let's talk outside.

15:31.010 --> 15:31.950
Hurry up.

15:31.980 --> 15:32.870
Hurry.

15:34.010 --> 15:35.410
Wait, what are you doing?

15:36.600 --> 15:37.660
Is the sky falling?

15:38.750 --> 15:39.280
Mr. Rong.

15:45.670 --> 15:46.120
Please

15:48.510 --> 15:49.970
take your medicine first.

16:04.320 --> 16:05.180
Without water?

16:23.830 --> 16:24.310
Say it.

16:27.960 --> 16:28.890
My condolences.

16:32.850 --> 16:34.380
My third uncle died, right?

16:36.480 --> 16:37.160
No?

16:37.480 --> 16:38.670
Well, who died?

16:38.670 --> 16:39.870
It's not a big deal. Why...

16:39.870 --> 16:41.480
Why did you give me this medicine?

16:41.480 --> 16:42.410
There's no need.

16:42.910 --> 16:43.640
Who? Tell me.

16:45.320 --> 16:47.190
Y-Ye Jian.

16:47.720 --> 16:48.780
Captain Ye is dead.

16:50.910 --> 16:51.590
Dead?

16:52.270 --> 16:52.720
Yes.

16:53.440 --> 16:54.120
Ye Jian...

16:56.200 --> 16:56.960
He's dead.

17:06.440 --> 17:07.530
Nonsense.

17:08.069 --> 17:09.200
That's impossible.

17:10.750 --> 17:12.720
I didn't believe it at first either.

17:12.720 --> 17:13.880
I just went to confirm it.

17:13.880 --> 17:14.750
Last night,

17:15.160 --> 17:15.960
he was killed.

17:22.200 --> 17:23.200
S-Say it again.

17:23.780 --> 17:25.180
He was killed last night.

17:25.880 --> 17:26.960
Think about who he was.

17:26.960 --> 17:28.420
Who would dare to hurt him?

17:29.200 --> 17:30.930
The police are investigating.

17:36.410 --> 17:37.610
Do you know who did it?

17:38.830 --> 17:40.610
Do you?

17:40.960 --> 17:41.640
We will find out.

17:41.640 --> 17:42.570
We will find out.

17:43.080 --> 17:44.020
We will find out.

17:47.110 --> 17:48.170
Leave. Just leave.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.580
Stop lingering in front of me. Go!

17:51.160 --> 17:52.020
Get out!

18:03.440 --> 18:04.070
Jianren.

18:05.110 --> 18:06.000
Get the sharks

18:06.000 --> 18:07.380
to stop moving!

18:07.400 --> 18:08.060
Okay.

18:10.000 --> 18:11.010
Stop moving!

18:11.110 --> 18:12.350
Stop moving!

18:14.400 --> 18:16.000
Mr. Rong, they...

18:18.640 --> 18:19.270
Mr. Rong!

18:21.110 --> 18:22.200
Mr. Rong!

18:22.350 --> 18:23.680
They're sharks!

18:25.070 --> 18:26.110
Where are the people?

18:26.110 --> 18:26.880
Come here!

18:39.250 --> 18:39.950
Mr. Rong.

18:40.550 --> 18:41.340
Are you okay?

18:52.190 --> 18:56.220
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital]

18:56.290 --> 19:00.170
[Orthopaedics Department] [Orthopaedics Section 1]

18:57.440 --> 18:59.160
My leg got hurt.
What are you crying out for?

18:59.160 --> 19:00.000
Well, you...

19:00.310 --> 19:00.840
Here.

19:00.960 --> 19:01.480
Okay.

19:01.720 --> 19:02.350
I'm fine.

19:02.350 --> 19:03.280
I'm really fine.

19:03.400 --> 19:04.070
Have a seat.

19:06.220 --> 19:14.210
[Orthopaedics Department] [Orthopaedics Section 1]

19:06.510 --> 19:07.160
Please wait a moment.

19:07.160 --> 19:07.750
I'll go get the X-rays.

19:07.750 --> 19:08.280
Go ahead.

19:39.680 --> 19:40.110
Hello.

19:40.480 --> 19:41.280
Hello, Chief.

19:41.510 --> 19:42.650
Li Feng has confessed to everything.

19:42.650 --> 19:43.710
Confessed to what?

19:43.960 --> 19:44.720
This Li Feng,

19:44.840 --> 19:46.300
over the past three years,

19:46.310 --> 19:48.440
has committed over a dozen robberies.

19:48.510 --> 19:49.790
Among them, nine involved murder,

19:49.790 --> 19:50.750
one attempted murder,

19:50.750 --> 19:52.640
resulting in fifteen deaths in total.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.510
He started to hide in Sanjiangkou
half a year ago.

19:54.510 --> 19:55.440
How many deaths?

19:55.480 --> 19:56.270
Fifteen.

19:57.610 --> 19:58.260
Chief.

19:58.480 --> 20:00.360
He is a Class A wanted criminal.

20:00.380 --> 20:01.680
For three consecutive years,

20:01.680 --> 20:02.480
the bureau has issued

20:02.480 --> 20:04.030
a priority arrest warrant for him.

20:04.030 --> 20:04.640
Across five provinces,

20:04.640 --> 20:07.070
tens of thousands of police officers
have been deployed to catch him.

20:07.070 --> 20:07.680
Several times,

20:07.680 --> 20:09.010
he was almost caught.

20:09.660 --> 20:10.580
So close.

20:10.920 --> 20:12.720
But he managed to escape every time.

20:12.720 --> 20:13.430
This time,

20:13.550 --> 20:15.380
you finally caught him.

20:24.310 --> 20:24.790
Chief?

20:25.550 --> 20:27.010
Chief, are you listening?

20:27.330 --> 20:29.820
[Orthopaedics Department] [Orthopaedics Section 1]

20:27.920 --> 20:29.160
Are you sure it's him?

20:29.880 --> 20:30.880
The fingerprints match.

20:30.880 --> 20:31.880
There's no doubt.

20:32.200 --> 20:33.350
The interrogation is still ongoing.

20:33.350 --> 20:35.000
Chief Qi and Captain Wang
are both keeping an eye on it.

20:35.000 --> 20:35.660
Good. Then,

20:36.750 --> 20:37.310
thanks for your hard work.

20:37.310 --> 20:39.110
Keep interrogating him for now.

20:40.570 --> 20:43.040
[Interrogation Room]

20:43.080 --> 20:46.420
[Orthopedic Section 1]

20:47.030 --> 20:48.690
That's quite an achievement.

20:49.690 --> 20:50.480
This is a year ahead of schedule,

20:50.480 --> 20:52.340
and I've overfulfilled the task.

20:53.680 --> 20:56.680
Does this mean
I can go back to the provincial capital?

21:04.830 --> 21:05.350
Chief.

21:08.440 --> 21:08.840
Chief.

21:08.890 --> 21:09.840
Why are you standing up?

21:09.840 --> 21:10.350
Well.

21:10.720 --> 21:11.440
I was just sitting here,

21:11.440 --> 21:12.170
and suddenly

21:12.400 --> 21:13.920
my whole leg cannot be felt.

21:13.920 --> 21:14.520
It's numb.

21:15.780 --> 21:16.930
Is it that serious?

21:19.590 --> 21:20.160
Look,

21:20.590 --> 21:21.850
I really can't feel it.

21:27.720 --> 21:29.780
You have to keep taking the medicine.

21:30.310 --> 21:31.040
And you

21:31.550 --> 21:32.810
should stay positive.

21:32.960 --> 21:34.020
In your daily life,

21:34.350 --> 21:35.920
watch more funny jokes,

21:36.310 --> 21:38.180
cross-talks, sketches,

21:38.270 --> 21:39.270
or comedy movies.

21:41.640 --> 21:43.040
He's been watching them.

21:47.920 --> 21:49.410
Your vital signs

21:49.880 --> 21:51.080
are all quite stable.

21:51.790 --> 21:54.120
Do you feel uncomfortable anywhere else?

21:57.200 --> 21:57.810
It hurts.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.330
What did you say?

22:00.720 --> 22:01.250
It hurts.

22:03.270 --> 22:04.160
Speak louder.

22:04.200 --> 22:05.590
My arm hurts!

22:10.680 --> 22:11.160
Arm.

22:14.590 --> 22:16.100
His arm hurts.

22:16.510 --> 22:17.040
How about

22:17.110 --> 22:19.370
you take him to orthopedics downstairs?

22:19.590 --> 22:20.030
Okay.

22:24.400 --> 22:24.880
Doctor,

22:25.440 --> 22:26.380
is he okay?

22:28.030 --> 22:29.090
His bones are fine.

22:29.310 --> 22:30.400
I'll just prescribe some medicine for him.

22:30.400 --> 22:30.980
Okay.

22:33.440 --> 22:34.500
Then could there be

22:34.890 --> 22:36.240
some neurological problem?

22:36.240 --> 22:37.880
Right now, not only
does my whole leg hurt,

22:37.880 --> 22:38.740
it's also numb.

22:40.110 --> 22:41.440
How about I get one of those

22:41.440 --> 22:42.400
full body checkups

22:42.400 --> 22:44.060
to examine my body carefully?

22:44.400 --> 22:46.070
Theoretically, it's not necessary.

22:46.070 --> 22:47.550
I don't think it's anything serious.

22:47.550 --> 22:48.310
Don't you trust

22:48.310 --> 22:49.510
what the doctor says?

22:49.790 --> 22:51.030
She said theoretically.

22:51.030 --> 22:52.830
But my whole leg actually hurts.

22:53.240 --> 22:53.960
How about I go back to

22:53.960 --> 22:55.030
the provincial hospital for a checkup.

22:55.030 --> 22:56.480
After all, the medical facilities here...

22:56.210 --> 22:56.530
[Sanjiangkou People's Hospital Radiology Report]

22:56.720 --> 22:58.510
If you don't trust our hospital,

22:58.510 --> 22:59.910
you can go to another one.

23:02.840 --> 23:03.900
Are you his family?

23:04.510 --> 23:05.220
How about

23:05.420 --> 23:07.110
you take him to the fourth floor?

23:07.110 --> 23:08.160
The psychiatry department

23:08.160 --> 23:10.020
might be able to cure his illness.

23:13.440 --> 23:16.540
[Psychiatry Department]

23:18.000 --> 23:19.260
Mr. Rong, are you okay?

23:21.890 --> 23:23.420
Tell Bowen to come to see me.

23:25.160 --> 23:25.670
No need.

23:26.880 --> 23:27.880
We'll go find him.

23:29.640 --> 23:30.770
Bring your weapons.

23:33.160 --> 23:33.720
Mr. Rong.

23:34.790 --> 23:36.250
Are you suspecting that Ye

23:36.860 --> 23:38.340
was killed by Bowen?

23:42.110 --> 23:43.640
Killing someone

23:43.720 --> 23:45.160
isn't easy for an ordinary person,

23:45.160 --> 23:46.690
let alone killing another.

23:48.830 --> 23:50.520
On the birthday, I told Bowen

23:50.550 --> 23:51.910
to clean up his mess,

23:52.270 --> 23:53.880
or Ye wouldn't show mercy.

23:55.070 --> 23:56.130
Then Ye was killed.

23:57.310 --> 23:57.920
Who else

23:57.940 --> 23:59.340
could I suspect for this?

24:00.160 --> 24:01.280
If it really is him,

24:01.830 --> 24:03.630
I'll have to clean house myself.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.690
If he dares to hurt Ye,

24:06.160 --> 24:08.220
he'll dare to hurt me sooner or later.

24:16.240 --> 24:20.690
[Psychiatry Department]

24:16.410 --> 24:17.920
Why are we on the fourth floor?

24:17.920 --> 24:18.590
Didn't the doctor ask you

24:18.590 --> 24:20.920
to come to the fourth floor
for a check-up?

24:27.070 --> 24:27.870
Xing, tell me,

24:28.570 --> 24:29.830
do I look like a psycho?

24:31.070 --> 24:31.680
Didn't you say

24:31.680 --> 24:33.070
you want a full checkup?

24:39.310 --> 24:40.760
Killing 15 people.

24:41.070 --> 24:43.530
How many times
would he be executed for that?

24:43.550 --> 24:45.010
Let's not talk about work.

24:46.160 --> 24:47.210
You have all kinds of experiences.

24:47.210 --> 24:49.140
I still have a lot to learn from you.

25:01.440 --> 25:02.030
Seriously, do people nowadays

25:02.030 --> 25:03.290
really brag that much?

25:03.510 --> 25:04.510
Just ignore them.

25:05.240 --> 25:06.720
They were going to the fourth floor.

25:06.720 --> 25:07.980
They might be psychos.

25:09.680 --> 25:11.810
I just came down from the fourth floor.

25:12.880 --> 25:13.410
Mr. Rong.

25:14.030 --> 25:16.000
I definitely wasn't talking about you.

25:16.000 --> 25:17.480
Then why come to orthopedics?

25:17.480 --> 25:18.590
Didn't the doctor just ask us to

25:18.590 --> 25:20.310
come to orthopedics on the second floor?

25:20.310 --> 25:21.690
Why come to orthopedics?

25:21.260 --> 25:23.590
[Orthopedics Department]

25:21.790 --> 25:23.000
Since we're here, let's have a check-up.

25:23.000 --> 25:23.350
No, no.

25:23.350 --> 25:24.200
Let's have a thorough check-up.

25:23.660 --> 25:24.690
[Orthopedics Section 2]

25:24.200 --> 25:24.930
No, I refuse.

25:28.920 --> 25:30.920
Even if one really killed 15 people,

25:32.310 --> 25:34.170
he can only be shot once if caught.

25:43.310 --> 25:43.900
Li Feng.

25:44.680 --> 25:46.810
Start confessing from the first case.

25:47.880 --> 25:48.880
Can I start confessing

25:48.880 --> 25:50.080
from the second case?

25:50.240 --> 25:51.640
Mind your attitude.

25:52.930 --> 25:54.620
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau Personal Information Form]

25:55.110 --> 25:56.150
You and Li Feng

25:56.180 --> 25:57.710
grew up in the same village.

25:57.960 --> 25:59.480
You are one year younger than him,

25:59.480 --> 26:01.210
so you were childhood friends.

26:01.640 --> 26:02.810
When you were 16,

26:03.030 --> 26:05.830
you were raped by your uncle
from the same village.

26:06.030 --> 26:07.830
He was a villain in your village.

26:08.310 --> 26:10.310
Your parents were threatened by him

26:10.400 --> 26:11.930
and didn't dare to speak up.

26:12.270 --> 26:13.330
After Li Feng found out,

26:13.330 --> 26:15.190
he went to him to settle the score.

26:15.480 --> 26:16.480
During the fight,

26:17.190 --> 26:18.790
he accidentally killed him.

26:19.750 --> 26:21.880
He was sentenced to 12 years in prison.

26:22.070 --> 26:22.920
This is the

26:22.920 --> 26:24.380
first crime he committed.

26:25.200 --> 26:26.070
I killed people

26:27.480 --> 26:28.680
because fate was

26:28.680 --> 26:29.880
too unfair to my wife.

26:30.160 --> 26:31.360
After I was released,

26:31.750 --> 26:34.410
I found out
she was forced to marry someone else.

26:34.510 --> 26:36.240
That jerk didn't love her at all.

26:35.080 --> 26:42.900
♪ The moon is hanging far away in the night ♪

26:37.170 --> 26:39.100
After finding out she was raped,

26:39.310 --> 26:40.840
not only did he not help her,

26:40.960 --> 26:43.400
but he also beat her constantly.

26:43.830 --> 26:45.270
He forced her to do that

26:44.230 --> 26:50.700
♪ Lighting up the pedestrians' faces ♪

26:45.880 --> 26:46.960
to support him.

26:48.350 --> 26:50.720
In a fit of rage, I killed his whole family.

26:50.760 --> 26:52.090
They were all scumbags.

26:52.740 --> 26:59.080
♪ Why are you standing in the center of the city? ♪

26:53.700 --> 26:55.200
Then I let her elope with me.

26:55.200 --> 26:57.110
Li Feng constantly committed robberies

26:57.110 --> 26:57.950
and thefts

26:58.070 --> 26:59.030
to make a living.

26:59.920 --> 27:00.880
During the time, he killed

27:00.090 --> 27:07.220
♪ But I couldn't find my way home ♪

27:00.880 --> 27:02.410
multiple innocent people.

27:05.110 --> 27:06.270
Besides these 15 lives,

27:06.270 --> 27:07.470
are there any others?

27:15.550 --> 27:16.030
No.

27:16.830 --> 27:18.440
Let me ask you another question.

27:18.440 --> 27:18.920
Li Feng,

27:19.030 --> 27:20.890
you were doing fine in Jiangsu,

27:20.960 --> 27:22.400
and the police didn't track you down.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.960
Why did you come to Sanjiangkou?

27:23.960 --> 27:25.160
To hide from you guys.

27:27.830 --> 27:28.420
Half a year ago,

27:28.420 --> 27:29.750
we came to Sanjiangkou.

27:31.110 --> 27:33.040
Then we didn't want to run anymore,

27:34.200 --> 27:36.310
so we took over a small shop
and settled down.

27:36.310 --> 27:37.440
One day, on the street,

27:37.440 --> 27:38.900
I ran into an old cellmate.

27:39.750 --> 27:41.240
He said someone hired him to kill a person.

27:41.240 --> 27:43.000
The remuneration was 200,000 yuan.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.440
He wanted my help and promised

27:44.440 --> 27:45.830
to give me half of the money.

27:45.830 --> 27:46.550
So I agreed.

27:48.640 --> 27:49.840
I only found out later

27:50.030 --> 27:51.270
that the target

27:52.350 --> 27:53.440
was an old cop.

27:53.920 --> 27:54.680
A cop?

27:54.750 --> 27:56.830
Seemed like he was a superior official.

27:56.830 --> 27:57.880
What was his name?

27:59.200 --> 28:00.200
I don't remember.

28:01.640 --> 28:02.350
I think...

28:04.240 --> 28:05.770
I think his last name was Lu.

28:08.240 --> 28:08.790
Chief Qi.

28:10.590 --> 28:11.990
Keep interrogating him.

28:13.590 --> 28:14.030
Show him the photo.

28:14.030 --> 28:14.360
Okay.

28:15.160 --> 28:16.000
Because of my leg injury,

28:16.000 --> 28:16.960
I might need to go back to...

28:16.960 --> 28:17.910
Sit down first, Yi'ang.

28:17.910 --> 28:18.460
Sit.

28:20.000 --> 28:20.800
What's wrong?

28:29.750 --> 28:30.680
Is he the target?

28:38.110 --> 28:38.550
Yes.

28:40.680 --> 28:41.240
And then?

28:42.680 --> 28:43.450
Did you do it?

28:43.680 --> 28:44.110
No.

28:44.960 --> 28:46.020
I wanted to at first

28:46.640 --> 28:47.590
because my child is too young,

28:47.590 --> 28:49.270
and I would need
a lot of money in the future.

28:49.270 --> 28:50.930
I thought if I did this one job,

28:51.350 --> 28:52.590
even if I got caught,

28:52.720 --> 28:54.780
it'd be good to leave them some money.

28:55.750 --> 28:57.610
Later, my wife talked me out of it.

28:58.030 --> 28:58.760
Afterwards,

28:59.640 --> 29:00.480
I went soft.

29:01.440 --> 29:02.160
My cellmate

29:02.160 --> 29:04.020
never contacted me again either.

29:05.590 --> 29:07.130
Was this cop named Lu

29:07.250 --> 29:08.320
killed later?

29:09.790 --> 29:11.590
I wasn't involved. I don't know.

29:11.830 --> 29:12.590
But I guess

29:12.590 --> 29:13.990
my cellmate didn't do it.

29:14.400 --> 29:15.730
He didn't have the guts.

29:16.920 --> 29:18.580
What's your cellmate's name?

29:21.510 --> 29:22.200
If you don't know his name,

29:22.200 --> 29:23.530
how about his nickname?

29:23.550 --> 29:25.410
Where did he live in Sanjiangkou?

29:27.110 --> 29:27.920
Sir,

29:29.160 --> 29:30.400
is the answer to this question

29:30.400 --> 29:31.770
important to you?

29:33.720 --> 29:34.350
Li Feng.

29:35.440 --> 29:36.240
Look at me.

29:37.750 --> 29:38.830
I'm asking you one last time.

29:38.830 --> 29:39.830
Speak properly.

29:42.640 --> 29:44.300
What's your cellmate's name?

29:44.810 --> 29:46.130
Who hired him?

29:48.970 --> 29:50.020
I can tell you,

29:51.110 --> 29:52.240
but I have a request.

29:53.310 --> 29:54.300
I want to see

29:54.400 --> 29:55.510
my wife and child.

29:59.110 --> 30:00.840
Someone wants to harm Chief Lu?

30:04.200 --> 30:05.260
Grant his request.

30:06.830 --> 30:07.410
Yi'ang.

30:07.830 --> 30:08.900
That's against the rules.

30:08.900 --> 30:09.960
What if they collude
to falsify statements?

30:09.960 --> 30:12.420
I'll take responsibility for any problems.

30:39.880 --> 30:40.440
Mr. Rong.

30:41.030 --> 30:42.070
What's so urgent

30:42.070 --> 30:43.830
that we can't talk about it on the phone?

30:43.830 --> 30:44.440
In the middle of the night,

30:44.440 --> 30:45.770
you came here in person.

30:49.400 --> 30:50.860
I'll go get you some water.

30:50.960 --> 30:51.890
Ren, have a seat.

30:52.110 --> 30:52.710
Yangyang.

30:54.110 --> 30:55.440
Go back to your room.

30:59.480 --> 31:00.960
Just do as Mr. Rong says.

31:16.000 --> 31:17.400
What happened, Mr. Rong?

31:18.240 --> 31:18.880
Ye

31:20.400 --> 31:21.030
is dead.

31:22.920 --> 31:23.310
Who?

31:25.680 --> 31:26.310
Ye Jian.

31:27.590 --> 31:28.250
Captain Ye.

31:30.000 --> 31:30.900
Dead?

31:31.440 --> 31:32.250
How did he die?

31:38.200 --> 31:39.170
You tell me

31:39.790 --> 31:40.880
how he died.

31:41.550 --> 31:42.450
Asking me?

31:43.640 --> 31:44.000
I...

31:44.110 --> 31:44.640
Bowen.

31:46.400 --> 31:47.600
Mr. Rong wants to know

31:48.000 --> 31:49.730
what you were doing last night.

31:57.030 --> 31:58.200
I was at home.

31:59.160 --> 32:00.420
Yangyang can prove it.

32:02.800 --> 32:03.370
Mr. Rong,

32:03.400 --> 32:04.750
you think I did it?

32:05.000 --> 32:05.830
He's a cop.

32:06.110 --> 32:07.720
Who in Sanjiangkou would dare to harm him?

32:07.720 --> 32:09.400
Who is the most experienced at this?

32:09.400 --> 32:10.750
Mr. Rong, I swear to God.

32:11.640 --> 32:12.960
-If I did it...
-If swearing works,

32:12.960 --> 32:14.560
why would we need the police?

32:14.680 --> 32:15.720
If I did it, kill me right now.

32:15.720 --> 32:16.070
Okay?

32:16.070 --> 32:16.750
You think I'm not

32:16.750 --> 32:17.730
going to do it?

32:24.590 --> 32:25.350
Don't move.

32:42.400 --> 32:43.310
Be careful.

32:44.720 --> 32:46.060
Don't let it misfire.

32:48.160 --> 32:48.840
Move away.

32:53.310 --> 32:54.480
You move away.

33:01.880 --> 33:02.880
Get out of the way.

33:03.640 --> 33:04.310
Mr. Rong.

33:05.400 --> 33:07.000
If you really don't trust me,

33:08.030 --> 33:09.360
then shoot me right now.

33:33.590 --> 33:34.450
Don't blame me.

33:35.680 --> 33:36.420
You know,

33:38.830 --> 33:39.510
I'm sick.

33:43.350 --> 33:43.880
Mr. Rong.

33:45.830 --> 33:48.420
Ye Jian was my bro too.

33:50.680 --> 33:53.570
How could I do something like that?

33:58.550 --> 33:59.110
Mr. Rong.

34:00.680 --> 34:02.740
This whole thing is getting weirder.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.880
That Chief Zhang

34:05.200 --> 34:06.750
came and took Ye's position.

34:06.750 --> 34:08.150
When he arrived, Ye died.

34:08.710 --> 34:09.330
So,

34:09.670 --> 34:10.730
who in Sanjiangkou

34:10.800 --> 34:12.460
has the capability to do that?

34:14.320 --> 34:15.760
Tell me the truth.

34:16.920 --> 34:18.070
How did you handle

34:19.320 --> 34:20.780
that thing half a year ago?

34:21.440 --> 34:22.010
Mr. Rong.

34:22.230 --> 34:23.880
Nothing will go wrong with that.

34:23.880 --> 34:25.540
I need to know all the details.

34:26.400 --> 34:28.199
I can't let anyone else get hurt.

34:29.480 --> 34:31.280
Half a year ago, I put the word out

34:31.400 --> 34:32.360
and hired a hitman

34:32.360 --> 34:33.080
called Fei.

34:33.760 --> 34:35.620
But he didn't dare to take the job.

34:36.000 --> 34:37.320
Does this Fei

34:37.550 --> 34:38.350
know about me?

34:40.360 --> 34:40.880
No.

34:44.440 --> 34:46.040
Do you have his contact info?

34:47.080 --> 34:48.610
I'll contact him right now.

34:49.670 --> 34:51.469
You don't need to worry about it.

34:51.880 --> 34:53.800
Give the address to Jianren.

34:54.800 --> 34:55.800
He will handle it.

35:03.550 --> 35:05.150
Mr. Rong, Ren, are you leaving now?

35:05.150 --> 35:06.070
Study hard.

35:06.230 --> 35:06.920
Rongcheng Group

35:06.920 --> 35:09.000
always has positions for young people.

35:09.000 --> 35:09.330
Come.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.280
Let me see you out.

35:10.280 --> 35:10.800
No need.

35:10.920 --> 35:11.780
We know the way.

35:14.510 --> 35:15.720
Take care, Mr. Rong.

35:22.620 --> 35:24.020
Why aren't you sleeping?

35:24.400 --> 35:24.980
Brother,

35:25.030 --> 35:25.820
between you and Mr. Rong,

35:25.820 --> 35:27.420
there's no bad blood, right?

35:27.800 --> 35:29.070
Don't go anywhere for now.

35:29.070 --> 35:30.270
Especially at night.

35:30.320 --> 35:31.530
Just stay at home.

35:32.230 --> 35:33.360
If you really have to go somewhere,

35:33.360 --> 35:34.490
you must let me know.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.240
Do you hear me?

35:38.590 --> 35:39.450
What happened?

35:40.190 --> 35:40.800
Whatever happened

35:40.800 --> 35:42.150
has nothing to do with you.

35:42.150 --> 35:43.680
Just remember what I said.

35:43.880 --> 35:45.630
How does it have nothing to do with me?

35:45.630 --> 35:46.480
You are my brother.

35:45.690 --> 35:47.990
[Lang Botu, Lang Bowen's younger brother]

35:46.480 --> 35:48.140
Your business is my business.

35:54.400 --> 35:55.520
Little kid.

35:56.030 --> 35:57.110
You think you've grown up

35:57.110 --> 35:59.040
and want to shoulder things for me?

35:59.190 --> 35:59.960
Wait until you

35:59.960 --> 36:00.760
don't have to do homework.

36:00.760 --> 36:01.630
Then we'll talk.

36:01.630 --> 36:02.830
I'm not a kid anymore.

36:05.840 --> 36:06.920
Your task right now

36:06.920 --> 36:07.840
is to study hard

36:07.840 --> 36:08.840
and study abroad.

36:10.550 --> 36:12.550
Don't get involved in our business.

36:35.280 --> 36:36.280
Sir, stop asking.

36:36.560 --> 36:37.480
If you don't grant my request,

36:37.480 --> 36:38.680
I won't say anything.

36:42.030 --> 36:42.690
I won't ask.

36:48.840 --> 36:49.800
Li Feng.

36:51.070 --> 36:51.590
Baby,

36:52.000 --> 36:52.440
look.

36:52.840 --> 36:53.640
That's Daddy.

36:56.670 --> 36:58.840
I have thought of a name for the child.

37:01.550 --> 37:03.010
He'll be named Li Feng too.

37:05.970 --> 37:08.130
I will bring him up

37:08.670 --> 37:10.150
stay with him all my life,

37:11.620 --> 37:13.780
and teach him to be a good person.

37:41.280 --> 37:42.340
Let's hit the road.

37:48.070 --> 37:48.920
Sir.

37:51.400 --> 37:52.890
My cellmate is called Fei,

37:53.510 --> 37:54.710
nicknamed Scarface.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.360
Ren.

38:10.550 --> 38:12.030
Let me go, Ren.

38:14.480 --> 38:15.150
Fei.

38:16.230 --> 38:17.840
Let me ask you a few questions.

38:17.840 --> 38:18.800
Tell the truth,

38:19.230 --> 38:20.290
and you'll be fine.

38:21.960 --> 38:22.550
Really?

38:23.400 --> 38:24.230
Okay.

38:24.710 --> 38:25.610
Does anyone else know

38:25.610 --> 38:27.400
that I hired you to kill that person?

38:27.400 --> 38:28.600
I didn't kill anyone.

38:35.710 --> 38:36.460
Bro.

38:44.010 --> 38:45.340
Listen to the question.

38:46.630 --> 38:47.690
Listen carefully.

38:47.710 --> 38:48.880
I remember it now.

38:48.960 --> 38:50.020
I remember it now.

38:50.140 --> 38:50.940
I remember it.

38:51.480 --> 38:52.920
Back then, I didn't dare to...

38:52.920 --> 38:54.700
I didn't dare to do it myself.

38:55.070 --> 38:55.560
So I...

38:55.630 --> 38:56.920
I found a cellmate of mine,

38:56.920 --> 38:57.720
named Li Feng.

38:59.840 --> 39:01.300
Before doing it, we agreed

39:01.300 --> 39:02.280
to meet at 7 p.m.

39:02.280 --> 39:03.190
at an intersection.

39:03.190 --> 39:03.960
But he didn't show up.

39:03.960 --> 39:05.070
I really didn't kill anyone.

39:05.070 --> 39:06.150
I really didn't.

39:07.480 --> 39:08.480
I didn't.

39:13.190 --> 39:14.120
Where is Li Feng?

39:16.550 --> 39:16.920
I...

39:17.960 --> 39:18.690
I don't know.

39:19.070 --> 39:20.470
I really don't know, Bro.

39:20.480 --> 39:21.760
I didn't trust him,

39:21.760 --> 39:23.230
so I didn't leave him

39:23.230 --> 39:24.320
my phone number.

39:25.280 --> 39:26.810
You had no his contact info.

39:27.360 --> 39:28.760
How did you contact him?

39:28.780 --> 39:29.440
Through QQ.

39:29.760 --> 39:31.230
I have his QQ number.

39:31.320 --> 39:32.150
Koukou?

39:32.320 --> 39:33.720
I have a computer at home.

39:33.920 --> 39:34.400
QQ.

39:34.440 --> 39:34.960
Yes.

39:34.960 --> 39:36.830
I have a computer at home.

39:37.480 --> 39:38.000
Typing.

39:39.440 --> 39:40.550
Get up quickly.

39:40.670 --> 39:41.560
Get up.

39:44.410 --> 39:45.870
It's a misunderstanding.

39:46.440 --> 39:47.050
Thanks for your hard work.

39:47.050 --> 39:47.840
It's fine.

